          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0001",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Libera nos Deus noster. Ita dicitur in principio horarum.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            64
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0002",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Domine labia mea aperies.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            64
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0003",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Et os meum annuntiabit laudem tuam.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            64
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0004",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Deus in adjutorium meum intende.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            64
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0005",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Domine ad adjuvandum me festina.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            64
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0006",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Gloria Patri, et Filio, et Spiritui Sancto, Sicut erat in principio, et nunc, et semper, et in saecula saeculorum. Amen.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            64
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0007",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "rubric",
          "source": "Non dicitur Alleluia, nec Laus tibi Domine.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            64
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0008",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "rubric",
          "source": "Hymnus",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            64
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0009",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Patris sapientia, veritas divina: Deus homo captus est hora matutina. A notis discipulis cito derelictus: A Judaeis traditus, venditus, et afflictus.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            64
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0010",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Antiph. O Crux venerabilis, quae salutem attulisti miseris: quibus te efferam praeconis, quoniam vitam nobis caelestem praeparasti?",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            64
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0011",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Adoramus te Christe, et benedicimus tibi.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            64
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0012",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Quia per sanctam Crucem tuam redemisti mundum.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            64
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0013",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Oremus,",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            64
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0014",
          "verification": "pending"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Domine Jesu Christe, Fili Dei vivi, pone Passionem, Crucem, et mortem tuam inter judicium tuum, et animam meam, nunc, et in hora mortis meae: et mihi largiri digneris gratiam et misericordiam: vivis et defunctis requiem et veniam: Ecclesiae tuae pacem et concordiam et nobis peccatoribus vitam et gloriam sempiternam. Qui vivis et regnas in saecula saeculorum. Amen.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            64
          ],
          "translation": null,
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "matins-b0015",
          "verification": "pending"
        }
      ]
